[
  {
    "content_id": "10062001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62001001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;論到從起初原有的生命之道，就是我們所聽見、所看見、親眼看過、親手摸過的。（</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62001002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;這生命已經顯現出來，我們也看見過，現在又作見證，將原與父同在、且顯現與我們那永遠的生命傳給你們。）</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62001003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我們將所看見、所聽見的傳給你們，使你們與我們相交。我們乃是與父並他兒子耶穌基督相交的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62001004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我們將這些話寫給你們，使你們的喜樂充足。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62001005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;上帝就是光，在他毫無黑暗。這是我們從主所聽見、又報給你們的信息。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62001006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我們若說是與上帝相交，卻仍在黑暗裏行，就是說謊話，不行真理了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62001007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;我們若在光明中行，如同上帝在光明中，就彼此相交，他兒子耶穌的血也洗淨我們一切的罪。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62001008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我們若說自己無罪，便是自欺，真理不在我們心裏了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62001009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我們若認自己的罪，上帝是信實的，是公義的，必要赦免我們的罪，洗淨我們一切的不義。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62001010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;我們若說自己沒有犯過罪，便是以上帝為說謊的，他的道也不在我們心裏了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我小子們哪，我將這些話寫給你們，是要叫你們不犯罪。若有人犯罪，在父那裏我們有一位中保，就是那義者耶穌基督。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;他為我們的罪作了挽回祭，不是單為我們的罪，也是為普天下人的罪。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我們若遵守他的誡命，就曉得是認識他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;人若說「我認識他」，卻不遵守他的誡命，便是說謊話的，真理也不在他心裏了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;凡遵守主道的，愛上帝的心在他裏面實在是完全的。從此，我們知道我們是在主裏面。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;人若說他住在主裏面，就該自己照主所行的去行。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;親愛的弟兄啊，我寫給你們的，不是一條新命令，乃是你們從起初所受的舊命令；這舊命令就是你們所聽見的道。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;再者，我寫給你們的，是一條新命令，在主是真的，在你們也是真的；因為黑暗漸漸過去，真光已經照耀。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;人若說自己在光明中，卻恨他的弟兄，他到如今還是在黑暗裏。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;愛弟兄的，就是住在光明中，在他並沒有絆跌的緣由。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;惟獨恨弟兄的，是在黑暗裏，且在黑暗裏行，也不知道往哪裏去，因為黑暗叫他眼睛瞎了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;小子們哪，我寫信給你們， 因為你們的罪藉着主名得了赦免。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;父老啊，我寫信給你們， 因為你們認識那從起初原有的。 少年人哪，我寫信給你們， 因為你們勝了那惡者。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;小子們哪，我曾寫信給你們， 因為你們認識父。 父老啊，我曾寫信給你們， 因為你們認識那從起初原有的。 少年人哪，我曾寫信給你們； 因為你們剛強， 上帝的道常存在你們心裏； 你們也勝了那惡者。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;不要愛世界和世界上的事。人若愛世界，愛父的心就不在他裏面了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;因為，凡世界上的事，就像肉體的情慾、眼目的情慾，並今生的驕傲，都不是從父來的，乃是從世界來的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;這世界和其上的情慾都要過去，惟獨遵行上帝旨意的，是永遠常存。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;小子們哪，如今是末時了。你們曾聽見說，那敵基督的要來；現在已經有好些敵基督的出來了，從此我們就知道如今是末時了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;他們從我們中間出去，卻不是屬我們的；若是屬我們的，就必仍舊與我們同在；他們出去，顯明都不是屬我們的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;你們從那聖者受了恩膏，並且知道這一切的事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;我寫信給你們，不是因你們不知道真理，正是因你們知道，並且知道沒有虛謊是從真理出來的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;誰是說謊話的呢？不是那不認耶穌為基督的嗎？不認父與子的，這就是敵基督的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;凡不認子的，就沒有父；認子的，連父也有了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002024",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;論到你們，務要將那從起初所聽見的，常存在心裏。若將從起初所聽見的存在心裏，你們就必住在子裏面，也必住在父裏面。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002025",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;主所應許我們的就是永生。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002026",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;我將這些話寫給你們，是指着那引誘你們的人說的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002027",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;你們從主所受的恩膏常存在你們心裏，並不用人教訓你們，自有主的恩膏在凡事上教訓你們。這恩膏是真的，不是假的；你們要按這恩膏的教訓住在主裏面。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002028",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;小子們哪，你們要住在主裏面。這樣，他若顯現，我們就可以坦然無懼；當他來的時候，在他面前也不至於慚愧。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062002029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 2:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62002029",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;你們若知道他是公義的，就知道凡行公義之人都是他所生的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你看父賜給我們是何等的慈愛，使我們得稱為上帝的兒女；我們也真是他的兒女。世人所以不認識我們，是因未曾認識他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;親愛的弟兄啊，我們現在是上帝的兒女，將來如何，還未顯明；但我們知道，主若顯現，我們必要像他，因為必得見他的真體。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;凡向他有這指望的，就潔淨自己，像他潔淨一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;凡犯罪的，就是違背律法；違背律法就是罪。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你們知道主曾顯現，是要除掉人的罪，在他並沒有罪。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;凡住在他裏面的，就不犯罪；凡犯罪的，是未曾看見他，也未曾認識他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;小子們哪，不要被人誘惑。行義的才是義人，正如主是義的一樣。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;犯罪的是屬魔鬼，因為魔鬼從起初就犯罪。上帝的兒子顯現出來，為要除滅魔鬼的作為。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;凡從上帝生的，就不犯罪，因上帝的道存在他心裏；他也不能犯罪，因為他是由上帝生的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;從此就顯出誰是上帝的兒女，誰是魔鬼的兒女。凡不行義的就不屬上帝，不愛弟兄的也是如此。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;我們應當彼此相愛。這就是你們從起初所聽見的命令。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;不可像該隱；他是屬那惡者，殺了他的兄弟。為甚麼殺了他呢？因自己的行為是惡的，兄弟的行為是善的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;弟兄們，世人若恨你們，不要以為希奇。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我們因為愛弟兄，就曉得是已經出死入生了。沒有愛心的，仍住在死中。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;凡恨他弟兄的，就是殺人的；你們曉得凡殺人的，沒有永生存在他裏面。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;主為我們捨命，我們從此就知道何為愛；我們也當為弟兄捨命。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;凡有世上財物的，看見弟兄窮乏，卻塞住憐恤的心，愛上帝的心怎能存在他裏面呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;小子們哪，我們相愛，不要只在言語和舌頭上，總要在行為和誠實上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;從此就知道我們是屬真理的，並且我們的心在上帝面前可以安穩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;我們的心若責備我們，上帝比我們的心大，一切事沒有不知道的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;親愛的弟兄啊，我們的心若不責備我們，就可以向上帝坦然無懼了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003022",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;並且我們一切所求的，就從他得着；因為我們遵守他的命令，行他所喜悅的事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003023",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;上帝的命令就是叫我們信他兒子耶穌基督的名，且照他所賜給我們的命令彼此相愛。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062003024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 3:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62003024",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;遵守上帝命令的，就住在上帝裏面，上帝也住在他裏面。我們所以知道上帝住在我們裏面是因他所賜給我們的聖靈。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;親愛的弟兄啊，一切的靈，你們不可都信，總要試驗那些靈是出於上帝的不是，因為世上有許多假先知已經出來了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;凡靈認耶穌基督是成了肉身來的，就是出於上帝的；從此你們可以認出上帝的靈來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;凡靈不認耶穌，就不是出於上帝，這是那敵基督者的靈。你們從前聽見他要來，現在已經在世上了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;小子們哪，你們是屬上帝的，並且勝了他們；因為那在你們裏面的，比那在世界上的更大。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;他們是屬世界的，所以論世界的事，世人也聽從他們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;我們是屬上帝的，認識上帝的就聽從我們；不屬上帝的就不聽從我們。從此我們可以認出真理的靈和謬妄的靈來。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;親愛的弟兄啊，我們應當彼此相愛，因為愛是從上帝來的。凡有愛心的，都是由上帝而生，並且認識上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;沒有愛心的，就不認識上帝，因為上帝就是愛。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;上帝差他獨生子到世間來，使我們藉着他得生，上帝愛我們的心在此就顯明了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;不是我們愛上帝，乃是上帝愛我們，差他的兒子為我們的罪作了挽回祭，這就是愛了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;親愛的弟兄啊，上帝既是這樣愛我們，我們也當彼此相愛。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;從來沒有人見過上帝，我們若彼此相愛，上帝就住在我們裏面，愛他的心在我們裏面得以完全了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;上帝將他的靈賜給我們，從此就知道我們是住在他裏面，他也住在我們裏面。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;父差子作世人的救主；這是我們所看見且作見證的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;凡認耶穌為上帝兒子的，上帝就住在他裏面，他也住在上帝裏面。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;上帝愛我們的心，我們也知道也信。 上帝就是愛；住在愛裏面的，就是住在上帝裏面，上帝也住在他裏面。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;這樣，愛在我們裏面得以完全，我們就可以在審判的日子坦然無懼。因為他如何，我們在這世上也如何。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;愛裏沒有懼怕；愛既完全，就把懼怕除去。因為懼怕裏含着刑罰，懼怕的人在愛裏未得完全。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;我們愛，因為上帝先愛我們。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;人若說「我愛上帝」，卻恨他的弟兄，就是說謊話的；不愛他所看見的弟兄，就不能愛沒有看見的上帝。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062004021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 4:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62004021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;愛上帝的，也當愛弟兄，這是我們從上帝所受的命令。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005001",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;凡信耶穌是基督的，都是從上帝而生，凡愛生他之上帝的，也必愛從上帝生的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005002",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;我們若愛上帝，又遵守他的誡命，從此就知道我們愛上帝的兒女。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005003",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我們遵守上帝的誡命，這就是愛他了，並且他的誡命不是難守的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005004",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;因為凡從上帝生的，就勝過世界；使我們勝了世界的，就是我們的信心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005005",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;勝過世界的是誰呢？不是那信耶穌是上帝兒子的嗎？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005006",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;這藉着水和血而來的，就是耶穌基督；不是單用水，乃是用水又用血，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005007",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;並且有聖靈作見證，因為聖靈就是真理。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005008",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;作見證的原來有三：就是聖靈、水，與血，這三樣也都歸於一。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005009",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我們既領受人的見證，上帝的見證更該領受了，因上帝的見證是為他兒子作的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005010",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;信上帝兒子的，就有這見證在他心裏；不信上帝的，就是將上帝當作說謊的，因不信上帝為他兒子作的見證。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005011",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;這見證就是上帝賜給我們永生；這永生也是在他兒子裏面。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005012",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;人有了上帝的兒子就有生命，沒有上帝的兒子就沒有生命。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005013",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;我將這些話寫給你們信奉上帝兒子之名的人，要叫你們知道自己有永生。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005014",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我們若照他的旨意求甚麼，他就聽我們，這是我們向他所存坦然無懼的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005015",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;既然知道他聽我們一切所求的，就知道我們所求於他的，無不得着。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005016",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;人若看見弟兄犯了不至於死的罪，就當為他祈求，上帝必將生命賜給他；有至於死的罪，我不說當為這罪祈求。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005017",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;凡不義的事都是罪，也有不至於死的罪。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005018",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;我們知道凡從上帝生的，必不犯罪，從上帝生的，必保守自己，那惡者也就無法害他。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005019",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;我們知道，我們是屬上帝的，全世界都臥在那惡者手下。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005020",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;我們也知道，上帝的兒子已經來到，且將智慧賜給我們，使我們認識那位真實的，我們也在那位真實的裏面，就是在他兒子耶穌基督裏面。這是真神，也是永生。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10062005021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "約翰一書 5:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "62005021",
    "language": "zht",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;小子們哪，你們要自守，遠避偶像！</p>"
  }
]